                                                EX Encoded
                                  off           1 E...A...... Not Dolby
                                                Surround EX Encoded
                                  dpliiz        3 E...A...... Dolby Pro
                                                Logic IIz-encoded
    -dheadphone_mode int      Dolby Headphone Mode (from -1 to 2) (default
                              -1)
                                values:
