FLAC encoder AVOptions ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    -lpc_coeff_precision int  LPC coefficient precision (from 0 to 15)
                              (default 15)
    -lpc_type int             LPC algorithm (from -1 to 3) (default -1)
                                values:
                                  none      0 E...A......
                                  fixed     1 E...A......
                                  levinson  2 E...A......
                                  cholesky  3 E...A......
    -lpc_passes int           Number of passes to use for Cholesky
                              factorization during LPC analysis (from 1 to
                              INT_MAX) (default 2)
    -min_partition_order int  (from -1 to 8) (default -1)
    -max_partition_order int  (from -1 to 8) (default -1)
    -prediction_order_method int Search method for selecting prediction
                              order (from -1 to 5) (default -1) 2level 1
                              E...A...... 4level 2 E...A...... 8level 3
                              E...A......
                                values:
                                  estimation  0 E...A......
                                  search      4 E...A......
                                  log         5 E...A......
    -ch_mode int              Stereo decorrelation mode (from -1 to 3)
                              (default auto)
                                values:
                                  auto        -1 E...A......
                                  indep       0 E...A......
                                  left_side   1 E...A......
                                  right_side  2 E...A......
                                  mid_side    3 E...A......
    -exact_rice_parameters boolean Calculate rice parameters exactly
                              (default false)
    -multi_dim_quant boolean  Multi-dimensional quantization (default false)
    -min_prediction_order int (from -1 to 32) (default -1)
    -max_prediction_order int (from -1 to 32) (default -1)

Mlpenc AVOptions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    -max_interval int         Max number of frames between each new header
                              (from 8 to 128) (default 16)
    -lpc_coeff_precision int  LPC coefficient precision (from 0 to 15)
                              (default 15)
    -lpc_type int             LPC algorithm (from 2 to 3) (default levinson)
                                values:
                                  levinson  2 E...A......
                                  cholesky  3 E...A......
    -lpc_passes int           Number of passes to use for Cholesky
                              factorization during LPC analysis (from 1 to
                              INT_MAX) (default 2)
    -codebook_search int      Max number of codebook searches (from 1 to
                              100) (default 3)
    -prediction_order int     Search method for selecting prediction order
                              (from 0 to 4) (default estimation)
                                values:
                                  estimation  0 E...A......
                                  search      4 E...A......
    -rematrix_precision int   Rematrix coefficient precision (from 0 to 14)
                              (default 1)

