                              E..V....... Average variable-bitrate
                                values:
                                  auto  0 E..V....... Choose mode
                                        automatically based on other
                                        parameters
    -profile int              Set profile (seq_profile) (from -99 to 255)
                              (default -99)
                                values:
                                  main          0 E..V.......
                                  high          1 E..V.......
                                  professional  2 E..V.......
    -tier int                 Set tier (seq_tier) (from 0 to 1) (default
                              main)
                                values:
                                  main  0 E..V.......
                                  high  1 E..V.......
    -level int                Set level (seq_level_idx) (from -99 to 31)
                              (default -99) 2.0 0 E..V....... 2.1 1
                              E..V....... 3.0 4 E..V....... 3.1 5
                              E..V....... 4.0 8 E..V....... 4.1 9
                              E..V....... 5.0 12 E..V....... 5.1 13
