                              64) (default 2)
    -max_frame_size int       Maximum frame size (in bytes) (from 0 to
                              INT_MAX) (default 0)
    -rc_mode int              Set rate control mode (from 0 to 6) (default
                              auto) CQP 1 E..V....... Constant-quality CBR 2
                              E..V....... Constant-bitrate VBR 3 E..V.......
                              Variable-bitrate ICQ 4 E..V....... Intelligent
                              constant-quality QVBR 5 E..V.......
                              Quality-defined variable-bitrate AVBR 6
                              E..V....... Average variable-bitrate
                                values:
                                  auto  0 E..V....... Choose mode
                                        automatically based on other
                                        parameters
    -qp int                   Constant QP (for P-frames; scaled by
                              qfactor/qoffset for I/B) (from 0 to 52)
                              (default 0)
    -aud boolean              Include AUD (default false)
    -profile int              Set profile (general_profile_idc) (from -99 to
                              255) (default -99)
                                values:
                                  main    1 E..V.......
                                  main10  2 E..V.......
                                  rext    4 E..V.......
    -tier int                 Set tier (general_tier_flag) (from 0 to 1)
                              (default main)
                                values:
                                  main  0 E..V.......
                                  high  1 E..V.......
    -level int                Set level (general_level_idc) (from -99 to
                              255) (default -99) 1 30 E..V....... 2 60
                              E..V....... 2.1 63 E..V....... 3 90
                              E..V....... 3.1 93 E..V....... 4 120
                              E..V....... 4.1 123 E..V....... 5 150
                              E..V....... 5.1 153 E..V....... 5.2 156
                              E..V....... 6 180 E..V....... 6.1 183
                              E..V....... 6.2 186 E..V.......
    -sei flags                Set SEI to include (default hdr+a53_cc)
                                values:
                                  hdr     E..V....... Include HDR metadata
                                          for mastering display colour
                                          volume and content light level
                                          information
                                  a53_cc  E..V....... Include A/53 caption
                                          data
    -tiles image_size         Tile columns x rows

Mjpeg_vaapi AVOptions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    -low_power boolean        Use low-power encoding mode (only available on
                              some platforms; may not support all encoding
                              features) (default false)
    -idr_interval int         Distance (in I-frames) between IDR frames
                              (from 0 to INT_MAX) (default 0)
    -b_depth int              Maximum B-frame reference depth (from 1 to
                              INT_MAX) (default 1)
    -async_depth int          Maximum processing parallelism. Increase this
                              to improve single channel performance. This
                              option doesn't work if driver doesn't
                              implement vaSyncBuffer function. (from 1 to
                              64) (default 2)
    -max_frame_size int       Maximum frame size (in bytes) (from 0 to
                              INT_MAX) (default 0)
    -jfif boolean             Include JFIF header (default false)
    -huffman boolean          Include huffman tables (default true)

Mpeg2_vaapi AVOptions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    -low_power boolean        Use low-power encoding mode (only available on
                              some platforms; may not support all encoding
                              features) (default false)
    -idr_interval int         Distance (in I-frames) between IDR frames
