                              65535) (default 0)
    -txt_top int              y offset of generated bitmaps (from 0 to
                              65535) (default 0)
    -txt_chop_spaces int      chops leading and trailing spaces from text
                              (from 0 to 1) (default 1)
    -txt_duration int         display duration of teletext pages in msecs
                              (from -1 to 8.64e+07) (default -1)
    -txt_transparent int      force transparent background of the teletext
                              (from 0 to 1) (default 0)
    -txt_opacity int          set opacity of the transparent background
                              (from -1 to 255) (default -1)

