                                            deinterlacing (do nothing)
                                  bob       1 .D.V....... Bob deinterlacing
                                  adaptive  2 .D.V....... Adaptive
                                            deinterlacing
    -gpu string               GPU to be used for decoding
    -surfaces int             Maximum surfaces to be used for decoding (from
                              -1 to INT_MAX) (default -1)
    -drop_second_field boolean Drop second field when deinterlacing (default
                              false)
    -crop string              Crop (top)x(bottom)x(left)x(right)
    -resize string            Resize (width)x(height)

